{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"507904","name":"奔霄颂玉轮","desc":"月之四版本活动 奔霄颂玉轮","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/01/30/50494840/b7f906c56d9b81007f426b853dd083de_3197221676200133037.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"游戏内活动说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"【活动简介】\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e又逢一年海灯佳节，你与派蒙回到了热闹的璃月港…\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"【参与条件】\\t\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e冒险等阶达到20级，并完成魔神任务「巨龙与自由之歌」。（完成魔神任务「真实之月」后体验更佳。）\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"【活动规则】\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e「奔霄颂玉轮」活动分为四个主题：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e主题一·「笔腾墨跃」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e回忆着伙伴们的身手，想象他们全力奔驰的模样吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e主题二·「如意斗彩」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e尽情施展拳脚，获取如意钱吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e主题三·「月映仙踪」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在说书人的故事里化身为仙人，击败詹诸，守护人们的心愿吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e主题四·「月引明霄」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e点亮霄灯，为朋友们留下祝词吧。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8910","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"更多信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"官方资讯\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/72733306\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e「奔霄颂玉轮」活动：参与获取瑶瑶衣装，自选邀约璃月4星角色\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/72711877\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e奔霄颂玉轮——活动介绍\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关任务\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"507914\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"ht